Subject: [PATCH] media: correlate capture exports by allocator and direct DMA
 identity

---
 .../platform/amlogic/t7-hdmirx/t7-vdin-test.c |  6 ++-
 .../amlogic/t7-hdmirx/test_export_identity.py | 49 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../amlogic/t7-hdmirx/test_hdr_resources.py   |  2 +
 .../chips-media/wave5/wave5-vpu-enc.c         | 18 +++++--
 include/trace/events/t7_vdin.h                | 16 +++---
